174
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,520
Mustache bastard.
小鬍子混蛋。

175
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,960
Okay, those people just left.
好吧，那些人剛離開。

176
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:49,960
