打擾一下。

179
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,480
Ah, ha, ha, ha.
啊哈哈哈哈。

180
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:23,060
So you like the drums?
那你喜歡鼓嗎？

181
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:25,320
Oh, that's, that's great.
噢，那是，那太好了。

182
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,960
You know, I was worried that, you know,
你知道，我擔心，你知道，

183
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,420
they would create maybe an unbearable
他們可能會造成難以忍受的

184
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,120
living situation, but...
生活狀況，但是…

185
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:35,500
Okay, well, apparently not, so yay!
好吧，顯然不是，所以耶！

186
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,060
Hey, hey, Deeps, check it out.
嘿，嘿，迪普斯，看看吧。

187
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,040
We already learned a song.
我們已經學了一首歌。

188
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:39,300
Ready?
準備好？

189
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,400
One, two, three, four.
一、二、三、四。

190
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:44,800
Tequila!
龍舌蘭酒！

191
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,020
That's fun.
這很有趣。

192
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:56,860
Here you go.
幹得好。

193
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:58,140
Thank you.
謝謝。

194
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:58,940
You got there? Put it there.
你到了嗎？把它放在那裡。

195
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:04,360
Definitely not easier with coins.
用硬幣絕對不容易。

196
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:07,020
Thank you.
謝謝。

197
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:07,620
Thank you.
謝謝。

198
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,380
Hey, hey, hey.
嘿，嘿，嘿。

199
00:09:12,020 --> 00:09:14,360
Here, now I only owe you 49.50.
在這裡，現在我只欠你49.50。

200
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:17,900
Hey, Pheebs.
嘿，菲比斯。

201
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,160
Hey.
嘿。

202
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,660
If you want to get Joey a Christmas present
如果你想送喬伊聖誕禮物

203
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:22,320
that disrupts the entire building,
擾亂了整個建築，

204
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:24,600
why not get him something a little bit more subtle,
為什麼不給他一些更微妙的東西，

205
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,500
like a wrecking ball or a vial of smallpox
就像一個破碎球或一瓶天花

206
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,700
to release in the hallway?
在走廊釋放？

207
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,540
It's not just the drum noise.
這不僅僅是鼓聲。

208
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,000
Every five minutes,
每五分鐘，

209
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:34,480
Joey throws his sticks in the air,
喬伊將棍子拋向空中，

210
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:35,340
and I have to hear,
我必須聽到，

211
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:37,740
Oh, my eye! Oh, God, my eye!
哦，我的眼睛！哦，上帝，我的眼睛！

212
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,980
I mean, it's so annoying.
我的意思是，這太煩人了。

213
00:09:40,300 --> 00:09:41,440
Yes, thank you.
是的，謝謝。

214
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:43,060
You see, this is how normal people
你看，正常人就是這樣的

215
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:44,840
are supposed to react to drums.
應該對鼓做出反應。

216
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:50,260
Phoebe, you got Joey drums to annoy Rachel
菲比，你讓喬伊打鼓來惹惱瑞秋

217
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,580
so she wouldn't want to live there anymore?
所以她不想再住在那裡了？

218
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,560
Maybe on some level.
也許在某種程度上。

219
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:05,080
Joey, you know that you could just not
喬伊，你知道你不能

220
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,420
throw the sticks up in the air.
將棍子拋向空中。

221
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:08,040
What is rock and roll about that?
搖滾樂到底是什麼？

222
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,520
Hey, Joey.
嘿，喬伊。

223
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:12,980
I got you another present.
我又為你準備了一份禮物。

224
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:22,100
Okay, what is it?
好吧，那是什麼？

225
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:25,220
Uh, it's a tarantula!
呃，這是一隻狼蛛！

226
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,000
Oh!
哦！

227
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,820
God!
上帝！

228
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,180
Rachel, I'm sorry.
雷切爾，對不起。

229
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,160
What was I thinking,
我在想什麼，

230
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:38,520
giving Joey this big, gross, scary spider
給喬伊這隻又大又噁心又可怕的蜘蛛

231
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:41,200
in such a poorly constructed cage?
在這麼簡陋的籠子裡？

232
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:43,800
What are you talking about?
你在說什麼？

233
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,800
I love them!
我愛他們！

234
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,960
I had a tarantula when I was a kid.
我小時候養過一隻狼蛛。

235
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:51,640
But it died because my cat ate it.
但它死了，因為我的貓吃了它。

236
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:53,600
And then, yeah, my cat died.
然後，是的，我的貓死了。

237
00:10:54,780 --> 00:10:56,320
But, Joey, isn't this cool?
但是，喬伊，這不是很酷嗎？

238
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:57,340
Is it on me?
是在我身上嗎？

239
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,420
I feel like it's on me.
我感覺它在我身上。

240
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:04,240
Oh, isn't that adorable?
噢，這不是很可愛嗎？

241
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:06,460
Joey is afraid of the tarantula.
喬伊害怕狼蛛。

242
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:07,440
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

243
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,800
He's so adorable.
他真是太可愛了。

244
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:10,780
God, he's just so much fun.
天哪，他真是太有趣了。

245
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:11,600
Joey's the best.
喬伊是最棒的。

246
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,040
I'm glad you're having so much fun here.
我很高興你在這裡玩得很開心。

247
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:14,360
Whoa, wait, wait.
哇，等等，等等。

248
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,120
What, Phoebe, what's the matter?
菲比，怎麼了？

249
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,120
Our apartment is ready.
我們的公寓已經準備好了。

250
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:23,200
And that makes you angry because...
這會讓你生氣，因為...

251
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,540
Because you would rather live here with Joey.
因為你寧願和喬伊住在這裡。

252
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:27,560
Where did you get that?
你從哪裡得到的？

253
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:31,340
Monica and Chandler said that you were having so much fun here.
莫妮卡和錢德勒說你們在這裡玩得很開心。

254
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:35,320
And apparently no amount of drums or tarantulas is gonna change that.
顯然，再多的鼓或狼蛛也無法改變這一點。

255
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:38,740
Phoebe?
菲比？

256
00:11:39,180 --> 00:11:39,360
Hmm?
唔？

257
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,980
Did you get all this stuff for Joey
你買了這些東西給喬伊嗎

258
00:11:40,980 --> 00:11:42,940
to try and drive me out of the apartment?
試著把我趕出公寓？

259
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:45,580
Honey, if you wanted to do that,
親愛的，如果你想這麼做，

260
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:47,020
you might as well have just gotten him a fish.
你還不如買條魚給他。

261
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,600
You know how fish freak me out?
你知道魚是如何嚇到我的嗎？

262
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:50,920
Fish.
魚。

263
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,860
But it wouldn't have mattered anyway, Phoebe.
但無論如何，這都不重要，菲比。

264
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,540
You and I are gonna live together.
你和我要住在一起。

265
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:57,940
We're roommates. That's the deal.
我們是室友。就是這樣。

266
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,540
Yes, but I wanted you to want to live with me.
是的，但我希望你願意和我住在一起。

267
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:03,900
But, okay, if you're having so much fun over here...
但是，好吧，如果你在這裡玩得很開心的話...

268
00:12:03,900 --> 00:12:05,780
Oh, it's so much more fun with you.
哦，和你在一起更有趣。

269
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:07,460
We did have fun, didn't we?
我們確實玩得很開心，不是嗎？

270
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,060
We had so much fun.
我們玩得很開心。

271
00:12:09,060 --> 00:12:11,600
You remember that time we were playing with the Super Bowl
你還記得那次我們參加超級盃比賽

272
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:14,320
and we accidentally threw it through the window and it broke?
我們不小心把它扔進了窗戶，它就碎了？

273
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,660
I remember paying for the window,
我記得付了窗費

274
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,240
but I don't remember how it broke.
但我不記得它是怎麼壞的。

275
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,800
Yeah, stuff like that.
是的，諸如此類的事情。

276
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:23,620
Yeah, yeah.
是啊是啊。

277
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:27,080
Anyway, they say if we want, we could see it tonight.
不管怎樣，他們說如果我們願意的話，我們今晚就可以看到。

278
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,180
Ah, I would love to!
啊，我很願意！

279
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,200
Yay, okay!
耶，好吧！

280
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:31,420
Great! All right, good!
偉大的！好吧，很好！

281
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:35,220
Oh, and Monica asked me to make the drumming stop.
哦，莫妮卡讓我停止敲鼓。

282
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:37,540
Um...
嗯...

283
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,240
Done!
完畢！

284
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:48,620
Hey.
嘿。

285
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:51,560
Hello, sir. You here to return those pants?
你好先生。你是來退貨的嗎？

286
00:12:58,020 --> 00:12:59,540
No, these are my pants.
不，這是我的褲子。

287
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,740
Oh. Okay.
哦。好的。

288
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:05,060
How can I help you?
我怎麼幫你？

289
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,700
Well, um, do you have a Santa outfit left?
嗯，你還有聖誕老人服裝嗎？

290
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:09,380
Two days before Christmas?
聖誕節前兩天？

291
00:13:09,660 --> 00:13:11,640
Sorry, man. Did you try Costume City?
對不起，夥計。你嘗試過服裝城嗎？

292
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:13,160
Yeah, yeah, I've tried everywhere.
是啊是啊，我到處都試過了。

293
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:15,560
Please, please, I mean, I'll pay extra.
拜託，拜託，我的意思是，我會支付額外費用。

294
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:20,020
Sorry, but I do have 74 of them coming back on the 26th.
抱歉，我確實有 74 個人會在 26 號回來。

295
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:24,880
Okay, look, do you have anything Christmassy?
好吧，看看，你有什麼聖誕禮物嗎？

296
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:28,420
I promised my son and I really don't want to disappoint him.
我答應了兒子，我真的不想讓他失望。

297
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:31,340
Um, come on, you gotta have something.
嗯，來吧，你得有一些東西。

298
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:34,820
I'm the Holiday Armadillo!
我是假日犰狳！

299
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:39,700
I'm a friend of Santa's,
我是聖誕老公公的朋友

300
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:45,160
and he sent me here to wish you a Merry Christmas!
他派我來這裡祝你聖誕快樂！

301
00:13:46,580 --> 00:13:50,020
What happened to Santa, Holiday Armadillo?
聖誕老人，假日犰狳怎麼了？

302
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:56,380
Santa was unavailable so close to Christmas.
臨近聖誕節，聖誕老公公沒能到場。

303
00:13:58,180 --> 00:13:59,960
Oh, come in, have a seat.
哦，進來吧，坐吧。

304
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:03,400
You must be exhausted coming all the way from Texas.
你從德州千里迢迢趕來，一定很累了。

305
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,740
Texas?
德克薩斯州？

306
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:07,680
Texas?
德克薩斯州？

307
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,300
That's right, Ben.
沒錯，本。

308
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:14,820
I'm Santa's representative for all the southern states.
我是所有南方各州的聖誕老人代表。

309
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:17,640
And Mexico!
還有墨西哥！

310
00:14:20,020 --> 00:14:25,220
But Santa sent me here to give you these presents, Ben.
但聖誕老人派我來這裡是為了給你這些禮物，本。

311
00:14:26,140 --> 00:14:28,140
Maybe the lady will help me with these presents.
也許那位女士會幫我買這些禮物。

312
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:45,300
Wow!
哇！

313
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:46,080
Wow, thanks!
哇，謝謝！

314
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:49,000
You're welcome, Ben. Merry Christmas.
不客氣，本。聖誕快樂。

315
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:53,260
And Happy Hanukkah!
光明節快樂！

316
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:58,740
Are you for Hanukkah too? Because I'm part Jewish.
你也來光明節嗎？因為我有部分猶太血統。

317
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:01,400
You are? Me too!
你是？我也是！

318
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:06,280
Because armadillos also wandered in the desert?
因為犰狳也在沙漠中徘徊？

319
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:11,000
You want to wander in the hall?
你想在大廳閒晃嗎？

320
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:15,020
Hey, Ben!
嘿，本！

321
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:21,400
What if the Holiday Armadillo told you all about the Festival of Lights?
如果節日犰狳告訴你有關排燈節的一切怎麼辦？

322
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:22,280
Cool!
涼爽的！

323
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:23,800
Come on, Ben.
來吧，本。

324
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:34,280
Years and years ago, there were these people called the Maccabees.
許多年前，有一些人被稱為馬卡比人。

325
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:37,100
Ho, ho, ho! Merry Christmas!
嗬，嗬，嗬！聖誕快樂！

326
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:40,540
Santa!
聖誕老人！

327
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:41,580
Hey!
嘿！

328
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:45,420
What are you doing here, Santa?
你在這裡做什麼，聖誕老人？

329
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:50,920
Well, I'm here to see my old buddy, Ben.
嗯，我是來看我的老朋友本的。

330
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,300
What are you doing here?
你在這裡做什麼？

331
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:56,620
Weird... turtle men?
奇怪……龜人？

332
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,400
I'm the Holiday Armadillo!
我是假日犰狳！

333
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:04,640
Your part Jewish friend!
你的猶太朋友！

334
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:11,660
You sent me here to give Ben some presents, remember?
你派我來這裡是為了給本一些禮物，記得嗎？

335
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:15,100
What?
什麼？

336
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,600
Did you bring me any presents, Santa?
聖誕老人，你帶禮物了嗎？

337
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:24,020
You bet I did, Ben! Put it there!
你打賭我做到了，本！把它放在那裡！

338
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:33,120
Well, it would have worked this time if his hands weren't so damn small.
好吧，如果他的手不是那麼小的話，這次應該可以成功。

339
00:16:36,940 --> 00:16:38,160
Ho, ho, ho!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

340
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:41,380
Okay, Ben, why don't you come open some more presents,
好吧，本，為什麼不再開啟一些禮物呢？

341
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:44,340
and Santa, the Armadillo, and I will have a little talk in the kitchen.
聖誕老公公、犰狳和我會在廚房聊一會兒。

342
00:16:45,180 --> 00:16:46,920
There's a sentence I never thought I'd say.
有句話我從來沒想過會說出來。

343
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:50,720
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

344
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:54,740
You called everyone and said you were having trouble finding a Santa costume,
你打電話給所有人說你找不到聖誕老人服裝，

345
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:56,860
so I borrowed one from a guy at work.
所以我跟同事借了一個。

346
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:59,640
Thank you, but you gotta leave.
謝謝你，但你得走了。

347
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:00,620
Why?
為什麼？

348
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:04,280
Because I'm finally getting him excited about Hanukkah!
因為我終於讓他對光明節感到興奮了！

349
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,940
I mean, you're wrecking it!
我的意思是，你正在破壞它！

350
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:09,680
But I didn't get to shake my belly like a bowl full of jelly!
但我還來不及把肚子像一碗果凍一樣晃來晃去！

351
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:16,900
I'm sorry, Chandler, but this is really important to me.
對不起，錢德勒，但這對我來說真的很重要。

352
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:20,780
Okay, fine, I'll give the suit back.
好吧，好吧，我會把衣服還給你。

353
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:24,760
Hey, you think you can keep it another night?
嘿，你覺得你可以再留一晚嗎？

354
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:29,420
Santa? Really?
聖誕老人？真的嗎？

355
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,600
Yeah, is that okay?
是啊，這樣可以嗎？

356
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:35,280
Did your dad ever dress up like Santa?
你爸爸曾經打扮成聖誕老公公嗎？

357
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:37,540
No.
不。

358
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:38,740
Then it's okay!
那就沒事了！

359
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:44,760
Okay, Ben, Santa has to go. Say goodbye!
好吧，本，聖誕老公公得走了。告別！

360
00:17:45,380 --> 00:17:47,580
No, why does he have to go?
不，他為什麼要走？

361
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:51,760
Because if Santa and the holiday...
因為如果聖誕老人和假期...

362
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:54,780
Armadillo...
犰狳...

363
00:17:56,680 --> 00:18:01,740
are ever in the same room for too long, the universe will implode!
在同一個房間呆太久，宇宙就會爆炸！

364
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:05,420
Merry Christmas!
聖誕快樂！

365
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:11,460
No, why can't the Armadillo leave? I want Santa!
不，為什麼犰狳不能離開？我想要聖誕老人！

366
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:17,720
Fine, I give up. Santa can stay!
好吧，我放棄了。聖誕老人可以留下來！

367
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:25,300
Well, I'll stay, but only because I want to hear about Hanukkah.
好吧，我會留下來，但只是因為我想聽聽光明節的事。

368
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:31,000
Ben, will you sit here with Santa and learn about Hanukkah?
本，你願意和聖誕老人​​一起坐在這裡瞭解光明節嗎？

369
00:18:31,660 --> 00:18:32,660
Okay, Santa!
好吧，聖誕老人！

370
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:41,160
All right, it's time for the story of Hanukkah!
好了，現在是光明節故事的時間了！

371
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:48,380
Years and years ago, there were these people called the Maccabees!
許多年前，有一些人被稱為馬卡比人！

372
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:50,100
Merry Christmas!
聖誕快樂！

373
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:03,420
Oh, wow! Look at this place!
哦，哇！看看這個地方！

374
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:07,900
Oh, this is terrible!
哦，這太可怕了！

375
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:12,980
Oh, they've made so many changes, I can't even feel my grandmother's presence anymore!
哎喲，變化太大了，我都感覺不到奶奶的存在了！

376
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:15,420
Oh, new sconces!
哦，新壁燈！

377
00:19:17,540 --> 00:19:18,460
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

378
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,100
What?
什麼？

379
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:25,060
Okay, remember how you told me that your grandmother put up that wall to make that into two bedrooms?
好吧，還記得你告訴我你祖母把那堵牆建起來，把它變成兩間臥室嗎？

380
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:25,860
Yeah.
是的。

381
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:29,920
And remember how you always said you were afraid that the landlord would find out and then tear it down?
還記得你總是說你害怕房東發現然後把它拆掉嗎？

382
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:30,640
Yeah.
是的。

383
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,340
Do you really not know where I'm going with this?
你真的不知道我要說的是什麼嗎？

384
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,580
No, of course I do!
不，我當然願意！

385
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:36,920
Okay.
好的。

386
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,540
What?
什麼？

387
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:41,740
It left! It's one huge room!
它離開了！這是一間很大的房間！

388
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:42,480
Oh, no!
哦，不！

389
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,080
Wow!
哇！

390
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:49,160
See?
看？

391
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,660
Well, I guess we'll just have to put the wall back up.
好吧，我想我們只需要把牆重新砌起來就可以了。

392
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:54,980
You can't, because of the new skylight!
你不能，因為有了新的天窗！

393
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:56,060
There's a skylight?
有天窗嗎？

394
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:58,560
Wow!
哇！

395
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:02,900
So, what should we do? Should we start looking for a new place?
那麼，我們該做什麼呢？我們應該開始尋找新的地方嗎？

396
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:12,220
You know, I'm sensing that my grandmother would not be comfortable with that.
你知道，我感覺到我的祖母對此會感到不舒服。

397
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:17,700
Oh, yeah? Starting to feel her again there, are we?
哦，是嗎？又開始感覺到她在那裡了，是嗎？

398
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:20,180
A little bit, yeah.
一點點，是的。

399
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:25,680
Phoebes, is your grandmother maybe saying that you should live here alone?
菲比，你祖母是不是在說你應該一個人住在這裡？

400
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:28,220
You heard it, too! You have the gift!
你也聽到了！你有禮物！

401
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:34,020
Phoebe, it's okay! I like living with Joey!
菲比，沒關係！我喜歡和喬伊住在一起！

402
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:35,700
Are you sure?
你確定嗎？

403
00:20:35,700 --> 00:20:40,320
Oh, please! I hate packing! It's closer to work, and we do have fun!
哦，拜託！我討厭打包！離工作更近了，我們也很開心！

404
00:20:43,220 --> 00:20:45,320
Although, I'm really going to miss living with you.
不過，我真的會想念和你一起生活的日子。

405
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:46,900
Oh, me too.
哦，我也是。

406
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:51,980
Oh, oh, wait! Did you hear that? Hear that? Listen!
噢，噢，等等！你聽到了嗎？聽到了嗎？聽！

407
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:52,420
Huh?
啊？

408
00:20:52,460 --> 00:20:53,500
I'm getting something from your grandmother.
我從你祖母那裡得到一些東西。

409
00:20:54,560 --> 00:21:00,620
She said that since you get to keep the one-bedroom apartment, you should give Rachel the purple chair?
她說既然你可以保留一間單人的公寓，你應該給雷切爾紫色的椅子嗎？

410
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:05,300
I do not hear that.
我沒有聽到。

411
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:11,860
Oh, no, wait a minute. Oh, okay. She didn't say chair, she said share.
哦，不，等一下。哦好的。她沒有說椅子，她說的是分享。

412
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:15,060
You should share the one-bedroom apartment.
你們應該共用一間臥室的公寓。

413
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:17,300
Oh, the purple chair! No, yeah, I heard that.
哦，紫色的椅子！不，是的，我聽到了。

414
00:21:17,740 --> 00:21:28,200
And the miracle was that that little bit of oil that should have lasted just one day burned for...
奇蹟在於，那一點點本應只持續一天的油燃燒了…

415
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,580
Eight whole days.
整整八天。

416
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:33,780
That's right, and that's why we celebrate Hanukkah today. The end.
沒錯，這就是我們今天慶祝光明節的原因。結束。

417
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:34,980
Awesome!
驚人的！

418
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:41,400
My favorite part was when Superman flew all the Jews out of Egypt.
我最喜歡的部分是超人將所有猶太人帶出埃及。

419
00:21:46,580 --> 00:21:50,260
The armadillo was actually not so thrilled about that part.
犰狳其實對這部分並不那麼興奮。

420
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:55,060
Why is Santa kissing Aunt Monica?
聖誕老公公為什麼要親吻莫妮卡阿姨？

421
00:21:56,020 --> 00:22:00,440
Because Aunt Monica was very, very good this year.
因為莫妮卡阿姨今年表現得非常非常好。

422
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:07,400
Okay, Ben, it's time to light the Hanukkah candles!
好吧，本，是時候點燃光明節蠟燭了！

423
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:22,380
Hey! Oh, wow! Looks like the Easter Bunny's funeral in here.
嘿！哦，哇！看起來復活節兔子的葬禮就在這裡舉行。

424
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:28,720
Come on, come on. We're lighting the candles. Come on.
來吧，來吧。我們正在點燃蠟燭。快點。

425
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:38,040
I understand why Superman is here, but why is there a porcupine at the Easter Bunny's funeral?
我明白為什麼超人在這裡，但為什麼復活節兔子的葬禮上有一隻豪豬？

426
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:47,240
Did you get it?
你收到了嗎？

427
00:22:47,900 --> 00:22:48,700
I got it.
我得到了它。

428
00:22:49,120 --> 00:22:50,260
Is it back in the cage?
它又回到籠子裡了嗎？

429
00:22:52,140 --> 00:22:54,060
It's back in the cage.
它又回到籠子裡了

430
00:22:54,060 --> 00:22:55,720
The cage closed.
籠子關上了。

431
00:22:57,980 --> 00:23:01,060
Joey, will you just come out here and stop being such a baby?
喬伊，你能到這裡來，別再像個小孩了嗎？

